      "content": "Hey, I'm looking into some emerging market opportunities in Central Africa. Can you do a quick stability assessment on a hypothetical region called the 'Zandoria Basin'? It's pretty diverse—we've got a mix of the Kamba people (who hold most of the political power), the Luvua group (who control the mining sectors), and a few smaller nomadic ethnic groups in the north. From a risk perspective, how much of a headache is that ethnic mix likely to be for long-term infrastructure projects?",
